msgid "Create Field Service jobs from mixed dispatch lists"
msgstr "Außendienstaufgaben aus gemischten Dispositionslisten erstellen"

#. module: abfall_fsm_dispatch
msgid ""
"\n"
"Creates mixed dispatch lists for stock transfers and one Field Service task\n"
"per transfer when the dispatch list is confirmed or updated.\n"
"    "
